{"id":"poberezh_e","lemma":"побережье","pos":"noun","rank":2334,"glosses":["shore, coast, seaboard, littoral"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/62/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B6%D1%8C%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B6%D1%8C%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"побережья","plural":"побережья"},"examples":[{"text":"Том живёт на побережье.","en":"Tom lives on the coast.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Я с западного побережья.","en":"I'm from the West Coast.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"with / from"},null,null]},{"text":"Его загородный дом находится на побережье.","en":"His cottage is on the coast.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"country"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"to be found","l":"находиться"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Город находится в двух милях от побережья.","en":"The town is two miles away from the coast.","words":[{"g":"city, town"},{"g":"to be found","l":"находиться"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"two","l":"два"},null,{"g":"from"},null]},{"text":"Мы ехали вдоль побережья.","en":"We drove along the coast.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go","l":"ехать"},{"g":"along"},null]}]}